---
import BlogLayout from "../../layouts/BlogLayout.astro";

const title = "Hong Kong eTAX Guide: How to File & Pay Taxes Online";
const description = "Complete Hong Kong eTAX guide. Learn how to open an eTAX account, file individual tax returns (BIR60), view assessments, request holdover, and pay online.";
const image = "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1460925895917-afdab827c52f?w=1200&q=80";
const canonical = "https://finsiva.com/blogs/hong-kong-etax-guide";

const faqSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "FAQPage",
  "mainEntity": [
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What is the Inland Revenue Department eTAX portal?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "eTAX is the IRD's online portal for electronic tax filing, viewing tax notices of assessment, calculating tax obligations, filing holdover applications, and managing electronic payments."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What extension do I get for filing my tax return on eTAX?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Taxpayers who file their Tax Return for Individuals (Form BIR60) electronically through eTAX automatically receive a 1-month filing extension beyond the standard 1-month paper return deadline."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "How can I apply for a holdover of provisional tax on eTAX?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "You can submit an online holdover application on eTAX at least 28 days before the payment due date if your assessable income has dropped by more than 10% compared to the previous year."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What payment methods are supported by IRD eTAX?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "eTAX supports electronic tax payments via PPS, FPS (Faster Payment System), internet banking, credit cards, and automated teller machines (ATMs)."
      }
    }
  ]
};
---

<BlogLayout title={title} description={description} image={image} canonical={canonical} author="Michael Tang" authorBio="Michael Tang is a tax technology analyst specializing in IRD electronic tax services, digital return filing, and eTAX procedures." lastUpdated="August 2026" readTime="10 min read">
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(faqSchema)} />

  <div class="min-h-screen bg-canvas dark:bg-canvas">
    <main class="min-h-screen">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="mb-6 text-sm">
          <ol class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><a href="/" class="text-link hover:underline dark:text-link">Home</a></li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-muted">/</span><a href="/blogs" class="text-link hover:underline dark:text-link">Blogs</a></li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-muted">/</span><span class="font-medium text-ink dark:text-on-primary" aria-current="page">Hong Kong eTAX Guide</span></li>
          </ol>
        </nav>

        <article class="prose max-w-none">
          <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-ink mb-4 dark:text-on-primary">Hong Kong eTAX Guide: Online Tax Filing, Assessments & Payment</h1>
          <p class="text-lg text-body dark:text-muted">Last updated: August 2026 | Verified IRD e-Services Guide | 10 min read</p>

          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1460925895917-afdab827c52f?w=1200&q=80" alt="Online tax filing on laptop computer - HK eTAX Guide" class="mb-6 w-full rounded-lg object-cover max-h-80 sm:max-h-96" loading="lazy" />

          <!-- Early Calculator CTA -->
          <div class="my-6 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-primary/30 bg-primary/5 dark:border-primary/20 dark:bg-primary/5 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4">
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink dark:text-on-primary">Estimate Your Tax Before Filing on eTAX</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-body dark:text-muted mt-1">Check progressive vs standard rate calculations and allowable MPF deductions instantly.</p>
            </div>
            <a href="/countries/hong-kong/salaries-tax/salaries-tax-calculator" class="btn btn-primary text-sm font-semibold shrink-0 px-5 py-2.5">
              Launch HK Tax Calculator →
            </a>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-8 space-y-6 text-body dark:text-muted leading-relaxed">
            <p>The Inland Revenue Department's <strong>eTAX system</strong> is the official digital portal for managing individual and corporate tax obligations in Hong Kong. Using eTAX allows taxpayers to file returns electronically, receive automatic filing extensions, view notices of assessment, pay taxes online, and submit holdover applications seamlessly.</p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink dark:text-on-primary">How to Register & Log In to eTAX</h2>
            <p>To register for an eTAX account, visit the official IRD website (<a href="https://www.ird.gov.hk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-link hover:underline dark:text-link">ird.gov.hk</a>) or use <strong>iAM Smart</strong> digital identity authentication:</p>
            <ol class="list-decimal pl-6 space-y-2">
              <li><strong>Via iAM Smart+:</strong> Log in instantly using your mobile iAM Smart app with digital signing functionality.</li>
              <li><strong>Via TIN & Password:</strong> Request an Access Code online using your HKID number and Taxpayer Identification Number (TIN). The IRD will send an authentication password by post or SMS.</li>
            </ol>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink dark:text-on-primary">Filing Individual Tax Returns (Form BIR60)</h2>
            <p>The IRD issues individual tax returns (BIR60) in early May each year. Key benefits of filing Form BIR60 via eTAX include:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
              <li><strong>Automatic 1-Month Filing Extension:</strong> eTAX users receive an extended deadline (typically July 1 instead of June 1).</li>
              <li><strong>Pre-filled Information:</strong> Salary data reported by your employer (Form BIR56B) and previous year allowance claims are automatically pre-populated.</li>
              <li><strong>Built-in Tax Estimator:</strong> eTAX automatically compares progressive rates (2% to 17%) against the 15% standard rate cap to determine your optimal calculation.</li>
            </ul>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink dark:text-on-primary">Viewing Assessment Notices & Electronic Demand Notes</h2>
            <p>After filing, notices of assessment and tax demand notes are issued electronically to your eTAX Message Box between October and January. The notice details your final tax assessment for the current year and the provisional tax estimate for the upcoming year.</p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink dark:text-on-primary">Electronic Tax Payment Methods</h2>
            <p>Taxpayers can pay HK tax demand notes directly through several digital channels:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
              <li><strong>Faster Payment System (FPS):</strong> Scan the QR code on your eTAX demand note using your banking app.</li>
              <li><strong>PPS (Pay by Phone Service):</strong> Enter merchant code `10` and your 11-digit payment reference number.</li>
              <li><strong>Credit Card & E-Banking:</strong> Pay via online banking or credit card portals.</li>
            </ul>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink dark:text-on-primary">Applying for Holdover of Provisional Tax Online</h2>
            <p>If your employment income drops by more than 10%, or if you become eligible for new personal allowances (e.g., birth of a child, marriage), you can submit an online <strong>Holdover of Provisional Tax Application</strong> via eTAX at least 28 days before the payment due date.</p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink dark:text-on-primary">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
            {faqSchema.mainEntity.map(faq => (
              <div class="my-4 p-4 rounded-xl border border-hairline bg-canvas dark:border-overlay-lighter dark:bg-surface">
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink dark:text-on-primary">{faq.name}</h3>
                <p class="text-sm text-body dark:text-muted mt-1 leading-relaxed">{faq.acceptedAnswer.text}</p>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>

          <!-- Internal Resource Linking Grid -->
          <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-hairline dark:border-overlay-lighter">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink mb-6 dark:text-on-primary">Hong Kong Tax Tools & Related Guides</h2>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
              <a href="/countries/hong-kong/salaries-tax/salaries-tax-calculator" class="block rounded-xl border border-hairline p-4 hover:border-primary transition bg-canvas dark:bg-surface dark:border-overlay-lighter">
                <h3 class="font-bold text-ink dark:text-on-primary text-sm">HK Salaries Tax Calculator</h3>
                <p class="text-xs text-muted mt-1">Estimate tax bill before eTAX filing.</p>
              </a>
              <a href="/blogs/hong-kong-salaries-tax-guide" class="block rounded-xl border border-hairline p-4 hover:border-primary transition bg-canvas dark:bg-surface dark:border-overlay-lighter">
                <h3 class="font-bold text-ink dark:text-on-primary text-sm">Hong Kong Salaries Tax Guide</h3>
                <p class="text-xs text-muted mt-1">Progressive brackets (2%-17%) & MPF rules.</p>
              </a>
              <a href="/blogs/hong-kong-tax-allowances-deductions" class="block rounded-xl border border-hairline p-4 hover:border-primary transition bg-canvas dark:bg-surface dark:border-overlay-lighter">
                <h3 class="font-bold text-ink dark:text-on-primary text-sm">Tax Allowances & Deductions</h3>
                <p class="text-xs text-muted mt-1">Personal allowances & MPF deductions.</p>
              </a>
              <a href="/blogs/hong-kong-property-tax-guide" class="block rounded-xl border border-hairline p-4 hover:border-primary transition bg-canvas dark:bg-surface dark:border-overlay-lighter">
                <h3 class="font-bold text-ink dark:text-on-primary text-sm">Hong Kong Property Tax Guide</h3>
                <p class="text-xs text-muted mt-1">File property tax returns on eTAX.</p>
              </a>
              <a href="/blogs/hong-kong-stamp-duty-guide" class="block rounded-xl border border-hairline p-4 hover:border-primary transition bg-canvas dark:bg-surface dark:border-overlay-lighter">
                <h3 class="font-bold text-ink dark:text-on-primary text-sm">Hong Kong Stamp Duty Guide</h3>
                <p class="text-xs text-muted mt-1">Online e-Stamping for leases & sales.</p>
              </a>
              <a href="/blogs/hong-kong-car-tax-guide" class="block rounded-xl border border-hairline p-4 hover:border-primary transition bg-canvas dark:bg-surface dark:border-overlay-lighter">
                <h3 class="font-bold text-ink dark:text-on-primary text-sm">Hong Kong Car Tax Guide</h3>
                <p class="text-xs text-muted mt-1">First Registration Tax & licensing.</p>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink mt-12 mb-6 dark:text-on-primary">Official Authorities & References</h2>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-body dark:text-muted">
            <li><a href="https://www.ird.gov.hk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-link hover:underline dark:text-link">Inland Revenue Department (IRD) - eTAX Official Portal</a></li>
            <li><a href="https://www.iam-smart.gov.hk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-link hover:underline dark:text-link">iAM Smart Digital Identity Portal</a></li>
            <li><a href="https://www.gov.hk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-link hover:underline dark:text-link">Hong Kong Government Official Portal</a></li>
          </ul>
        </article>
      </div>
    </main>
  </div>
</BlogLayout>
